First, the following expansion holds:
\begin{align*}
    e_m^{\top} \bigg(\mathbf{\widehat{U}}_k^{(t)} - &{\mathbf{U}}_k \mathbf{W}_k^{(t)}  - (\mathbf{I} - {\mathbf{U}}_k {\mathbf{U}}_k^{\top}) \mathbf{Z}_k \mathcal{\widehat P}^{(t)}_k \mathbf{V}_k \mathbf{\Lambda}_k {\mathbf{U}}_k^{\top} \mathbf{\widehat{U}}_k^{(t)} \mathbf{\widehat{\Lambda}}_k^{-2} \bigg) \\
