    &\quad + \frac{\sigma^2 \kappa \mu_0^3 r^{3/2} \log(p)}{p^3} + \frac{\sigma^3 \mu_0^5 r^3 \kappa^2 \log^{3/2}(p)}{\lambda p^{3/2}},
