The proof is similar to the proof of \cref{thm:civalidity}. First, by the proof of \cref{thm:asymptoticnormalityentries}, by applying the main expansion \eqref{mainentrywiseexpansion} to each entry separately, we have that with probability at least $1 - O(|J|p^{-9})$, it holds that
\begin{align*}
    \mathcal{T}_{J} &= \xi_{J} + O\bigg( |J|\frac{\sigma \kappa^2 \mu_0^3 r^{3/2} \sqrt{\log(p)}}{p^{3/2}} + |J| \frac{\sigma^2 \mu_0^4 \kappa^3 r^2 \log(p)}{\lambda \sqrt{p}} \bigg),
